Anteater Chess V1.0
Team 3 The Knight Owls
EECS 22L, Spring 2026

Authors: Akshithi Suresh, Jolynn Quang, Jasmine Kong, Troy Reindl, Ayda Ahmadian,Trisha Satyavrat

This is the final release of Anteater Chess, a customized chess program
where a human player can play against the computer or another human.

To install, type "make". For detailed instructions, refer to INSTALL.
For usage instructions, refer to doc/Chess_UserManual.pdf.